  <keyword>toWorkspace</keyword>
<keyword_alias>block:toWorkspace</keyword_alias>
  <short_description>Writes the input signal to a Nelson workspace variable.</short_description>
  <syntax>
    <syntax_item>Block type: toWorkspace</syntax_item>
  </syntax>
  <param_input>
    <param_input_item>
      <param_name>input ports</param_name>
      <param_description>1 input port (scalar or vector, any signal type).</param_description>
    </param_input_item>
  </param_input>
  <description>
    <p>Accumulates its input signal at major simulation steps and, when the simulation stops, writes it into the base-workspace variable <code>VariableName</code>.</p>
    <p>
      <img src="../../../../libraries/sink/exports/toWorkspace.svg" align="middle"/>
    </p>
    <p><code>Decimation</code> keeps one sample out of k (starting with the first). <code>MaxDataPoints</code> keeps only the last N decimated samples (<code>inf</code> keeps everything). <code>SaveFormat</code> selects the variable layout:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><code>Structure With Time</code>: fields <code>time</code>, <code>signals.values</code> (NxW), <code>signals.dimensions</code>, <code>signals.label</code>, <code>blockName</code>;</li>
      <li><code>Structure</code>: same with an empty <code>time</code>;</li>
      <li><code>Array</code>: NxW matrix of samples (use the simulation time grid for timing).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>In generated code the block is a no-op (workspace logging has no meaning there).</p>
    <p>
      <b>Parameters</b>
    </p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Parameter</th>
          <th>Default value</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>
            <code>VariableName</code>
          </td>
          <td>simout</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>
            <code>MaxDataPoints</code>
          </td>
          <td>inf</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>
            <code>Decimation</code>
          </td>
          <td>1</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>
            <code>SaveFormat</code>
          </td>
          <td>Structure With Time</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>
            <code>SampleTime</code>
          </td>
          <td>-1</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>
      <b>Block Characteristics</b>
    </p>
    <table border="1">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Block type</td>
          <td>toWorkspace</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Family</td>
          <td>Sink blocks</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Phases</td>
          <td>INIT, AFTER_STEP</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Signal data type</td>
          <td>any (recorded as double)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Code generation</td>
          <td>no-op</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>Code generation: supported for C and Rust.</p>
